  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_01",
      "hash64": "0E6C3D12073027DF",
      "text": "¡Por fin te dignas a aparecer, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nY sí, ya sé que ni siquiera habíamos quedado.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_02",
      "hash64": "0E6C3E1207302992",
      "text": "Verás, es que... quiero hablar contigo de algo.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_03",
      "hash64": "0E6C3F1207302B45",
      "text": "No le has contado a nadie lo que pasó ayer,\\n¡¿verdad?![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_01",
      "hash64": "04F744F15E1EA0FF",
      "text": "Claro que no",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_select_02",
      "hash64": "04F745F15E1EA2B2",
      "text": "¿Pasó algo?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_04",
      "hash64": "0E6C381207301F60",
      "text": "Espero que sea verdad. ¡Como me mientas,\\nte haré tragar un Koffing de un bocado![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_05",
      "hash64": "0E6C391207302113",
      "text": "¡Lo sabes perfectamente! Vimos al o... al o...\\n¡A lo que voy, y no me vaciles![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_06",
      "hash64": "0E6C3A12073022C6",
      "text": "Dime, ¿aún tienes eso que se le cayó a quien tú\\nya sabes en las escaleras?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_07",
      "hash64": "0E6C3B1207302479",
      "text": "Mi abuelo sabe un montón sobre la historia de\\nla villa. Quizá sería buena idea preguntarle por\\r\\nlo de ayer.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_08",
      "hash64": "0E6C4412073033C4",
      "text": "Sabes dónde vivimos, ¿no? Pues eso, no tardes.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_sister_09",
      "hash64": "0E6C451207303577",
      "text": "Enséñale al abuelo lo que tú ya sabes.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student1_01",
      "hash64": "9ECF9DCC98F6C72D",
      "text": "¡Solo he encontrado un cartel! Y Corin pasa de\\nmi cara... aunque admito que me gusta ese lado\\r\\nrebelde que tiene.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student2_01",
      "hash64": "459ADDB351A5A0BA",
      "text": "Cass parece bastante timidillo, pero diría que\\ncontigo ha hecho buenas migas.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_student3_01",
      "hash64": "1B1CC9BE9B0E2E6F",
      "text": "Con este calor, dan ganas de acercarse a un\\nYanma para que te abanique con las alas.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0210_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "03895AFDBDF115D5",
      "text": "El festival aún durará unos días. ¡Tienes tiempo\\nde sobra para disfrutarlo, mocit[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
